7	 * Step of {@code POST /api/owners}: normalises the owner {@code address} to its canonical form
8	 * (trim and collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand common abbreviations — see
9	 * {@link AddressNormalizer}). The canonical value is written back onto the (shared) request DTO so
10	 * it is stored and returned as {@code address}. Blank addresses are already rejected 400 upstream by
11	 * {@link RequireOwnerFields}, so by the time this runs the address is non-blank.
